CHEATBOOK.md
ROADMAP.md
PREMIUM_PLAN.md
FRONTEND_SPEC.md
# any *.notes.md / *.plan.md / scratch/ dumps
*.notes.md
*.plan.md
*.scratch.md
scratch/
notes/

